  "duration_s": 280.24,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "周凯，你们家住这破步梯房，连电梯都没有，楼道里一股油烟味儿熏都恶心，这是单位以前分的房老了点儿，但我爸妈特意打扫了一天，姑娘快坐，阿姨特意托人从乡下买的老母鸡，实打实做四个小时呢。阿姨，这上面浮着一层油，怎么下嘴啊？还有这桌子边角漆都掉了。第一次请人上门去大饭店订个包厢能花几个钱？真够寒碜的三观不合的感情，尽早止损。半年后，我遇见了苏晴同一个老小区，同是一桌家常菜，气氛却彻底变了小苏。快请进。哎呀，这老小区连个电梯都没有爬上来，累坏了吧。阿姨，好哪能累呀？我刚才进院子就觉得特别亲切，绿化好，邻里之间打招呼特别有人情味。现在那些高层总感觉少些烟火气，真没这儿住着舒服。小苏快尝尝这鸡汤。阿姨平时手一粗做不来，外头精致的大餐可能有点油，你别挑理啊。阿姨大饭店做的是生意，您这做的是暖意，这老母鸡一尝就是文火慢炖出来的本味儿，香气全在汤里，平时在外面净吃外卖，好久没喝到这么地道，又有锅气的好汤了，喜欢就多喝点小苏啊。阿姨，问你个问题，要是哪后你和周凯成的家，万一哪天我跟你闹了意见，你觉得周凯应该帮谁？阿姨，有您这么通情达理的长辈，我们哪舍得跟您闹意见呀？真要碰上想法，不一样的时候，谁有理就听谁的。您走过的路比我们吃过的盐都多，肯定是周凯先反省自己，尊重长辈，但要真是我年轻考虑不周，您随时敲打我，我心里只有感激，对这孩子太明事理了。苏晴，我现在是真服你了，怎么了？我妈说这老小区没电梯，楼道旧你一句话就夸得他喜笑颜开。吃饭时，他不自信，说鸡汤做油了没，外面大饭店好吃，换成我，我都不知道怎么接。后面他又突然问，你闹矛盾了，我该帮谁？我坐旁边听着都替你捏把汗，你到底是怎么练的？为什么别人突然给你一句话，你马上就知道该怎么接？其实我以前跟你一样，不爱说话，也不知道怎么组织语言，一到这种场合就不知道应该说什么。后来我就经常看这本把话说的恰到好处哦，它里面就是一个场景，一个场景的告诉你，遇到不同的人不同的话应该怎么接。比如别人夸你优秀，你可以回，那是不优秀点儿，怎么能和你做朋友呢？当别人说你真聪明，你就回近朱者赤，和你在一起啊，熏都熏出来了当领导跟你说，辛苦了，你就回领导，这都是我应该做的。强将手下无弱兵，我怎么能给您丢脸呢？难怪你每次都能接的这么快，这种东西不是天生的，就是平时一个场景，一个场景的看，一个场景，一个场景的练。每天看两页，慢慢积累一些不同场景之下，应该怎么说？这里面还有很多生活里的场景，比如对象给你发红包，你可以回你是我致富道路上最大的功臣。同事向你借钱，你又不想借，可以回，大家都是一样的年纪，你没有的，我能有吗？还有心仪的人跟你说我想你了，你可以回随便想，千万别跟我客气，目前不收费。哈哈这个有意思。我第一次读到这些的时候，也有种豁然开朗的感觉。这本书就是把工作、生活和人际交往里经常遇到的场景，一个一个拆开给你看，别人怎么说，你可以怎么接，都是一句句给你举例。所以你平时就是这么练的对啊，每天不用看很多看两页，碰到自己觉得有用的表达就记一记慢慢积累的多了。工作和生活里再碰到类似的场景，你就知道怎么接了。这本先借我看看，拿去吧，回去慢慢看。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00001",
      "start_ms": 870,
      "end_ms": 1350,
      "text": "周凯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1850,
      "end_ms": 3270,
      "text": "你们家住这破步梯房，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3270,
      "end_ms": 4330,
      "text": "连电梯都没有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00004",
      "start_ms": 4770,
      "end_ms": 6710,
      "text": "楼道里一股油烟味儿熏都恶心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00005",
      "start_ms": 8150,
      "end_ms": 10490,
      "text": "这是单位以前分的房老了点儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00006",
      "start_ms": 10570,
      "end_ms": 12215,
      "text": "但我爸妈特意打扫了一天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00007",
      "start_ms": 15560,
      "end_ms": 16220,
      "text": "姑娘快坐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00008",
      "start_ms": 16520,
      "end_ms": 19120,
      "text": "阿姨特意托人从乡下买的老母鸡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00009",
      "start_ms": 19120,
      "end_ms": 20565,
      "text": "实打实做四个小时呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00010",
      "start_ms": 26930,
      "end_ms": 27350,
      "text": "阿姨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00011",
      "start_ms": 27650,
      "end_ms": 28950,
      "text": "这上面浮着一层油，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00012",
      "start_ms": 29190,
      "end_ms": 30130,
      "text": "怎么下嘴啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00013",
      "start_ms": 30270,
      "end_ms": 32650,
      "text": "还有这桌子边角漆都掉了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00014",
      "start_ms": 32830,
      "end_ms": 36390,
      "text": "第一次请人上门去大饭店订个包厢能花几个钱？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00015",
      "start_ms": 37010,
      "end_ms": 45280,
      "text": "真够寒碜的三观不合的感情，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00016",
      "start_ms": 45960,
      "end_ms": 46815,
      "text": "尽早止损。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00017",
      "start_ms": 49070,
      "end_ms": 49650,
      "text": "半年后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00018",
      "start_ms": 50570,
      "end_ms": 53770,
      "text": "我遇见了苏晴同一个老小区，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00019",
      "start_ms": 54390,
      "end_ms": 55550,
      "text": "同是一桌家常菜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00020",
      "start_ms": 56190,
      "end_ms": 62490,
      "text": "气氛却彻底变了小苏。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00021",
      "start_ms": 62490,
      "end_ms": 63070,
      "text": "快请进。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00022",
      "start_ms": 63390,
      "end_ms": 63850,
      "text": "哎呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00023",
      "start_ms": 64430,
      "end_ms": 67530,
      "text": "这老小区连个电梯都没有爬上来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00024",
      "start_ms": 67530,
      "end_ms": 68230,
      "text": "累坏了吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00025",
      "start_ms": 68670,
      "end_ms": 68950,
      "text": "阿姨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00026",
      "start_ms": 68950,
      "end_ms": 70790,
      "text": "好哪能累呀？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00027",
      "start_ms": 71110,
      "end_ms": 73250,
      "text": "我刚才进院子就觉得特别亲切，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00028",
      "start_ms": 73790,
      "end_ms": 74390,
      "text": "绿化好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00029",
      "start_ms": 74690,
      "end_ms": 76950,
      "text": "邻里之间打招呼特别有人情味。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00030",
      "start_ms": 78510,
      "end_ms": 80910,
      "text": "现在那些高层总感觉少些烟火气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00031",
      "start_ms": 81710,
      "end_ms": 83010,
      "text": "真没这儿住着舒服。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00032",
      "start_ms": 83410,
      "end_ms": 84870,
      "text": "小苏快尝尝这鸡汤。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00033",
      "start_ms": 85530,
      "end_ms": 87630,
      "text": "阿姨平时手一粗做不来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00034",
      "start_ms": 87630,
      "end_ms": 89830,
      "text": "外头精致的大餐可能有点油，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00035",
      "start_ms": 89910,
      "end_ms": 91265,
      "text": "你别挑理啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00036",
      "start_ms": 97580,
      "end_ms": 100080,
      "text": "阿姨大饭店做的是生意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00037",
      "start_ms": 100100,
      "end_ms": 101220,
      "text": "您这做的是暖意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00038",
      "start_ms": 101720,
      "end_ms": 104820,
      "text": "这老母鸡一尝就是文火慢炖出来的本味儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00039",
      "start_ms": 104940,
      "end_ms": 106180,
      "text": "香气全在汤里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00040",
      "start_ms": 107060,
      "end_ms": 108700,
      "text": "平时在外面净吃外卖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00041",
      "start_ms": 109140,
      "end_ms": 110620,
      "text": "好久没喝到这么地道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00042",
      "start_ms": 110620,
      "end_ms": 111820,
      "text": "又有锅气的好汤了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00043",
      "start_ms": 113320,
      "end_ms": 115820,
      "text": "喜欢就多喝点小苏啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00044",
      "start_ms": 116000,
      "end_ms": 116300,
      "text": "阿姨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00045",
      "start_ms": 116300,
      "end_ms": 117000,
      "text": "问你个问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00046",
      "start_ms": 117260,
      "end_ms": 118680,
      "text": "要是哪后你和周凯成的家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00047",
      "start_ms": 119040,
      "end_ms": 120600,
      "text": "万一哪天我跟你闹了意见，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00048",
      "start_ms": 120660,
      "end_ms": 122005,
      "text": "你觉得周凯应该帮谁？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00049",
      "start_ms": 124230,
      "end_ms": 124765,
      "text": "阿姨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00050",
      "start_ms": 126090,
      "end_ms": 127650,
      "text": "有您这么通情达理的长辈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00051",
      "start_ms": 127950,
      "end_ms": 129765,
      "text": "我们哪舍得跟您闹意见呀？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00052",
      "start_ms": 130250,
      "end_ms": 131130,
      "text": "真要碰上想法，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00053",
      "start_ms": 131130,
      "end_ms": 132010,
      "text": "不一样的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00054",
      "start_ms": 132150,
      "end_ms": 133485,
      "text": "谁有理就听谁的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00055",
      "start_ms": 133830,
      "end_ms": 136050,
      "text": "您走过的路比我们吃过的盐都多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00056",
      "start_ms": 136170,
      "end_ms": 137670,
      "text": "肯定是周凯先反省自己，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00057",
      "start_ms": 137670,
      "end_ms": 138465,
      "text": "尊重长辈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00058",
      "start_ms": 139070,
      "end_ms": 140915,
      "text": "但要真是我年轻考虑不周，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00059",
      "start_ms": 141490,
      "end_ms": 142570,
      "text": "您随时敲打我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00060",
      "start_ms": 142710,
      "end_ms": 143965,
      "text": "我心里只有感激，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00061",
      "start_ms": 145520,
      "end_ms": 147975,
      "text": "对这孩子太明事理了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00062",
      "start_ms": 148840,
      "end_ms": 149435,
      "text": "苏晴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00063",
      "start_ms": 149970,
      "end_ms": 151115,
      "text": "我现在是真服你了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00064",
      "start_ms": 151480,
      "end_ms": 151935,
      "text": "怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00065",
      "start_ms": 152340,
      "end_ms": 154500,
      "text": "我妈说这老小区没电梯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00066",
      "start_ms": 154580,
      "end_ms": 157465,
      "text": "楼道旧你一句话就夸得他喜笑颜开。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00067",
      "start_ms": 158110,
      "end_ms": 158670,
      "text": "吃饭时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00068",
      "start_ms": 158670,
      "end_ms": 159250,
      "text": "他不自信，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00069",
      "start_ms": 159310,
      "end_ms": 160630,
      "text": "说鸡汤做油了没，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00070",
      "start_ms": 160630,
      "end_ms": 161575,
      "text": "外面大饭店好吃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00071",
      "start_ms": 161950,
      "end_ms": 162510,
      "text": "换成我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00072",
      "start_ms": 162510,
      "end_ms": 163465,
      "text": "我都不知道怎么接。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00073",
      "start_ms": 163820,
      "end_ms": 164780,
      "text": "后面他又突然问，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00074",
      "start_ms": 164780,
      "end_ms": 165700,
      "text": "你闹矛盾了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00075",
      "start_ms": 165700,
      "end_ms": 166505,
      "text": "我该帮谁？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00076",
      "start_ms": 167020,
      "end_ms": 168885,
      "text": "我坐旁边听着都替你捏把汗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00077",
      "start_ms": 169990,
      "end_ms": 171115,
      "text": "你到底是怎么练的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00078",
      "start_ms": 171590,
      "end_ms": 173070,
      "text": "为什么别人突然给你一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00079",
      "start_ms": 173210,
      "end_ms": 174705,
      "text": "你马上就知道该怎么接？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00080",
      "start_ms": 175060,
      "end_ms": 176385,
      "text": "其实我以前跟你一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00081",
      "start_ms": 176720,
      "end_ms": 177675,
      "text": "不爱说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00082",
      "start_ms": 178350,
      "end_ms": 179955,
      "text": "也不知道怎么组织语言，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00083",
      "start_ms": 180310,
      "end_ms": 182805,
      "text": "一到这种场合就不知道应该说什么。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00084",
      "start_ms": 183800,
      "end_ms": 187685,
      "text": "后来我就经常看这本把话说的恰到好处哦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00085",
      "start_ms": 188000,
      "end_ms": 189340,
      "text": "它里面就是一个场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00086",
      "start_ms": 189340,
      "end_ms": 190480,
      "text": "一个场景的告诉你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00087",
      "start_ms": 190540,
      "end_ms": 193075,
      "text": "遇到不同的人不同的话应该怎么接。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00088",
      "start_ms": 193700,
      "end_ms": 195215,
      "text": "比如别人夸你优秀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00089",
      "start_ms": 195600,
      "end_ms": 196345,
      "text": "你可以回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00090",
      "start_ms": 197130,
      "end_ms": 198370,
      "text": "那是不优秀点儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00091",
      "start_ms": 198370,
      "end_ms": 199750,
      "text": "怎么能和你做朋友呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00092",
      "start_ms": 199790,
      "end_ms": 201170,
      "text": "当别人说你真聪明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00093",
      "start_ms": 201170,
      "end_ms": 202800,
      "text": "你就回近朱者赤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00094",
      "start_ms": 202900,
      "end_ms": 203820,
      "text": "和你在一起啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00095",
      "start_ms": 203820,
      "end_ms": 206120,
      "text": "熏都熏出来了当领导跟你说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00096",
      "start_ms": 206120,
      "end_ms": 206720,
      "text": "辛苦了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00097",
      "start_ms": 206720,
      "end_ms": 207985,
      "text": "你就回领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00098",
      "start_ms": 208320,
      "end_ms": 209545,
      "text": "这都是我应该做的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00099",
      "start_ms": 209780,
      "end_ms": 211000,
      "text": "强将手下无弱兵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00100",
      "start_ms": 211060,
      "end_ms": 212365,
      "text": "我怎么能给您丢脸呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00101",
      "start_ms": 212810,
      "end_ms": 214575,
      "text": "难怪你每次都能接的这么快，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00102",
      "start_ms": 215360,
      "end_ms": 216885,
      "text": "这种东西不是天生的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00103",
      "start_ms": 217190,
      "end_ms": 218510,
      "text": "就是平时一个场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00104",
      "start_ms": 218510,
      "end_ms": 219455,
      "text": "一个场景的看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00105",
      "start_ms": 219760,
      "end_ms": 220340,
      "text": "一个场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00106",
      "start_ms": 220340,
      "end_ms": 221135,
      "text": "一个场景的练。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00107",
      "start_ms": 221430,
      "end_ms": 222405,
      "text": "每天看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00108",
      "start_ms": 222790,
      "end_ms": 224710,
      "text": "慢慢积累一些不同场景之下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00109",
      "start_ms": 224730,
      "end_ms": 225410,
      "text": "应该怎么说？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00110",
      "start_ms": 225770,
      "end_ms": 227725,
      "text": "这里面还有很多生活里的场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00111",
      "start_ms": 228100,
      "end_ms": 229520,
      "text": "比如对象给你发红包，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00112",
      "start_ms": 229580,
      "end_ms": 232655,
      "text": "你可以回你是我致富道路上最大的功臣。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00113",
      "start_ms": 233090,
      "end_ms": 234230,
      "text": "同事向你借钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00114",
      "start_ms": 234490,
      "end_ms": 235230,
      "text": "你又不想借，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00115",
      "start_ms": 235350,
      "end_ms": 235925,
      "text": "可以回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00116",
      "start_ms": 236290,
      "end_ms": 237610,
      "text": "大家都是一样的年纪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00117",
      "start_ms": 237610,
      "end_ms": 238210,
      "text": "你没有的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00118",
      "start_ms": 238210,
      "end_ms": 238965,
      "text": "我能有吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00119",
      "start_ms": 239280,
      "end_ms": 241500,
      "text": "还有心仪的人跟你说我想你了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00120",
      "start_ms": 241560,
      "end_ms": 243155,
      "text": "你可以回随便想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00121",
      "start_ms": 243430,
      "end_ms": 244690,
      "text": "千万别跟我客气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00122",
      "start_ms": 244790,
      "end_ms": 245715,
      "text": "目前不收费。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00123",
      "start_ms": 246450,
      "end_ms": 247805,
      "text": "哈哈这个有意思。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00124",
      "start_ms": 248230,
      "end_ms": 249630,
      "text": "我第一次读到这些的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00125",
      "start_ms": 249630,
      "end_ms": 251115,
      "text": "也有种豁然开朗的感觉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00126",
      "start_ms": 251580,
      "end_ms": 254975,
      "text": "这本书就是把工作、生活和人际交往里经常遇到的场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00127",
      "start_ms": 255260,
      "end_ms": 256705,
      "text": "一个一个拆开给你看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00128",
      "start_ms": 257300,
      "end_ms": 258040,
      "text": "别人怎么说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00129",
      "start_ms": 258100,
      "end_ms": 258795,
      "text": "你可以怎么接，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00130",
      "start_ms": 259130,
      "end_ms": 260355,
      "text": "都是一句句给你举例。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00131",
      "start_ms": 261240,
      "end_ms": 263680,
      "text": "所以你平时就是这么练的对啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00132",
      "start_ms": 264030,
      "end_ms": 265815,
      "text": "每天不用看很多看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00133",
      "start_ms": 266070,
      "end_ms": 269430,
      "text": "碰到自己觉得有用的表达就记一记慢慢积累的多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00134",
      "start_ms": 269510,
      "end_ms": 271570,
      "text": "工作和生活里再碰到类似的场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00135",
      "start_ms": 271570,
      "end_ms": 272605,
      "text": "你就知道怎么接了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00136",
      "start_ms": 274570,
      "end_ms": 275505,
      "text": "这本先借我看看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00137",
      "start_ms": 275870,
      "end_ms": 276445,
      "text": "拿去吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c58c58689d57b3cb_s00138",
      "start_ms": 276840,
      "end_ms": 277665,
      "text": "回去慢慢看。"
    }
  ],
